{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03604",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.31,
      "end_seconds": 6.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Good morning. I've just opened your notes. How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.1,
      "end_seconds": 17.81,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "Ah, mainly a flutter now and then. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 22.68,
      "end_seconds": 29.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pulse 65, BP is 121 over 82, saturation 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.16,
      "end_seconds": 33.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.79,
      "end_seconds": 61.64,
      "duration_seconds": 24.85,
      "text": "So, it's been going on for three weeks. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. As for cousin who died suddenly, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.52,
      "end_seconds": 67.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "What about breathlessness during sport, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.78,
      "end_seconds": 74.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "Yeah, that too. I mean, about breathlessness during sport, mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.0,
      "end_seconds": 75.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.85,
      "end_seconds": 92.22,
      "duration_seconds": 15.37,
      "text": "Oh, and chest tightness when pushing hard. That's been about the same, six months. About chest tightness when pushing hard, mostly moderate. It just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.12,
      "end_seconds": 99.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Have you had a flutter now and then before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.23,
      "end_seconds": 105.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "A bit, last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.86,
      "end_seconds": 112.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any leg swelling, fever, fainting or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.31,
      "end_seconds": 117.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.44,
      "end_seconds": 120.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.06,
      "end_seconds": 124.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "So, no, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.98,
      "end_seconds": 127.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.14,
      "end_seconds": 129.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.79,
      "end_seconds": 137.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.09,
      "end_seconds": 142.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Oh, yes, trimethoprim. I get a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.76,
      "end_seconds": 147.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.99,
      "end_seconds": 156.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.31,
      "text": "Yes, thin bones. I've had anxiety, yes. Heart disease, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.92,
      "end_seconds": 170.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "Right, right. Right, so thin bones is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.75,
      "end_seconds": 176.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.0,
      "end_seconds": 180.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "So, are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.07,
      "end_seconds": 185.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.81,
      "end_seconds": 198.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.37,
      "end_seconds": 205.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "My daughter has type 1 diabetes. My mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.83,
      "end_seconds": 209.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.1,
      "end_seconds": 217.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "Alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones. I take escitalopram, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.83,
      "end_seconds": 222.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "So, how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.2,
      "end_seconds": 225.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "It's 10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.61,
      "end_seconds": 226.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Hm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.34,
      "end_seconds": 235.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "Hmm, I'm on metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.29,
      "end_seconds": 236.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.21,
      "end_seconds": 246.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.29,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I'd been on aspirin, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.39,
      "end_seconds": 251.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.33,
      "end_seconds": 255.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Okay, tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.63,
      "end_seconds": 274.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "There is a harsh murmur that gets louder when you stand up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.1,
      "end_seconds": 283.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.41,
      "end_seconds": 310.5,
      "duration_seconds": 12.09,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is possible hypertrophic cardiomyopathy. It could also be an innocent flow murmur, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.97,
      "end_seconds": 321.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Have you had any tests for this so far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.4,
      "end_seconds": 332.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "I had an echocardiogram done at another clinic last year. I don't have the report with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.37,
      "end_seconds": 345.0,
      "duration_seconds": 10.63,
      "text": "No competitive sport until the heart scan, and we will check your close family. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.79,
      "end_seconds": 351.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Uh, um, alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.39,
      "end_seconds": 353.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}